  "readmeMarkdown": "# Antigravity APP Account Manager\n\n**Languages:** [简体中文](README.zh.md) | **English**\n\nQuickly manage your Antigravity account**s**.\n\n![Sample Screenshot](docs/assets/sample_screenshot.png)\n\n## How To Use\n\nSend one of the following messages to your Antigravity APP:\n\n- **Install**:\n  ```\n  Install this plugin: https://github.com/InfSein/antigravity-app-account-manager\n  ```\n- **Update**: `Update Antigravity Account Manager plugin`\n- **Uninstall**: `Uninstall Antigravity Account Manager plugin`\n\n> For AI agents: see [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) and [SKILL.md](skills/account-manager/SKILL.md) for fast zero-dependency install, update, and uninstall instructions.\n",
